# ============================================================
# EnvShare – Environment Variable Reference
# ============================================================
# The frontend (Vite/React) has NO env vars — nothing goes in the browser bundle.
#
# The ONE secret lives server-side in Google Cloud Secret Manager,
# accessed only by Firebase Cloud Functions. Set it with:
#
#   firebase functions:secrets:set ENCRYPTION_SECRET
#   (paste a strong random value when prompted)
#
# Generate a strong value:
#   openssl rand -base64 32
#
# The function uses:
#   key = PBKDF2(ENCRYPTION_SECRET, projectId || salt, 310_000 iter, SHA-256, 256-bit)
#   cipher = AES-256-GCM
#
# This secret is NEVER in the browser, NEVER in this file,
# NEVER in Vercel env vars — it lives only in GCP Secret Manager.
# ============================================================
